<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone strikes in the disputed Abyei border region have killed dozens of civilians, with Sudanese forces blaming the RSF for the attacks. Communal clashes linked to cattle rustling in South Sudan have left at least ten people dead, and a violent incident at Akol Koor’s residence has led to a lawsuit before the judiciary. Two prisoners of war are scheduled to return home from Akobo, while the governor has urged General John Kenyi Latio to end fighting in Wonduruba. Riek Machar denied commanding the White Army in court and political parties and civil society signed a peace pledge ahead of the 2026 elections, according to reports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE1Zc0dVWGU2SlJTeDhZYk12X1ZGWGpGVzJVYVFEckpRMjk4clY0SDZobE4zLU5oMzhoQXRXSWFUX2xyLVVfRFlyVGFVb2ctTVdmWHY3aE4wVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNTkZja2JVNUJZenJ5Wlg3cEVkWVkzQkZvSmN5WmVoOXUwVG5kbW0zcExRdHIwYm5NWDJhNDlOcXpnWGpxZm5RbDJrU2hxTFVRVzJCZGVnYW1MVVFDU0tmZHB6S2tRWFNObWZSa0tQNnphSjJseWM4X3BrSDR0b0F6Vlp4OVU1aUJBNXVZaG1uZzZnWDY4d3VqNl9NbTUzeUxraUktMkNxbDVibTd0bTJ6cnVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxQQWU3b0pmS2NwWE1kUjFZRUh2alhDdDFDMkREVHNvb2dIMHdsM2N4c1VFQXBLREVCV0xNMGdkSWdhTkxNWFdkek5VeWlOWlAyYlh0amtCVmU5cmxtRGs0cW1MSUxkdEdldm55ZWVUTGlVWnkwWE9NTy00eXc5LW1CWg?oc=5&quot;&gt;ChimpReports&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https:/